[Review Sprint 3] lasts 1 days

[Review Sprint 2] -> [Planificación Sprint 3]
[Planificación Sprint 3] -> [Wireframes 8 pantallas Balsamiq]
[Wireframes 8 pantallas Balsamiq] -> [Diagrama ER y Tablas SQL]
[Diagrama ER y Tablas SQL] -> [Review Sprint 3]

